T09:16:06Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-11-01T09:16:06Z"},"message":"tools: avoid rewriting same-version OpenSSL updates\n\nReplay the existing update branch onto the current target branch before\nrunning the updater on scheduled runs. Its version check then skips the\nsame version without rewriting the PR, preserving approvals and CI.\n\nThis also carries contributor commits into a newer update. Manual\ndispatches bypass the replay so the update can still be regenerated.\n\nSigned-off-by: Filip Skokan <panva.ip@gmail.com>\nAssisted-by: Codex\nPR-URL: https://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/66999\nReviewed-By: Antoine du Hamel <duhamelantoine1995@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"79e5f3cc9ae134937715e9da242379ddbdbbc1b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nodejs/node/git/trees/79e5f3cc9ae134937715e9da242379ddbdbbc1b7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nodejs/node/git/commits/95f3cf072e83d94ac90616c86a370b250f44a8d7","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJq5wNWCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAXM0QAF8pQVDtUzGwShWIxRB0Kxqa\nPxlyFS4yhHMPprztqf6XrZUEIgxT8ZLC/psop5eIf4iAlh0Yl6VubuidXG/m1Rdl\n8/zOURV6SAjtp4FIqaTfYLUrTClph/Hur+AzzpzkoRaBoIaZQ94fE2yHeWGxO9nH\ndxoBQbt40uaL4YW/nkxz6gjCkXTp9oadHPuU5duXkNlf7x0sBLyggn6DlfJtbrUe\nRvlnuVP1+TEAicib+jjXqwInf7RMbtuQzoT0F1Dsj43PocoDTkKW4/TU1PFhFKZr\nWmDic7nwzK7bOZIStStHZ4tNcyFU3jpBMawQgwTnOcpSTHvTzjaODGkIuTMid825\nJ9hRm6XUw+evHJiYWG9rrch3oVO7xCmzYSMDIY71tUk3GkHV0+AmTPeUXaTNMzD6\nnkHu/wqAASAFkJJoDwyMuwErMD7sghwPMUu2U3VUZpfuToygGsKiR2SBpSSgaw6c\nATkw0/v7ntMVnDULFZx/S7sgeIZfVcHD8CZdPZM14KoZmJfvCTqb4XfsGc6ZNFLP\n648VM3Yw5akpegUMakwqOnEAmRwuKAI4cGCTDN59eKkngvKNuY/DpbEaiCu9MEIs\nWmGHjPFjDtw0m+g3CLUNnd3CBI1d4x6OJxlYsKk3HKiygE7TBFZF6b+yEF7P6SFc\nd/pg2/tPH7+8iuKb+cYJ\n=odWV\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 79e5f3cc9ae134937715e9da242379ddbdbbc1b7\nparent bf246cf4b5b157c81a093f1feb9c9c814d030b2f\nauthor Filip Skokan <panva.ip@gmail.com> 1793524566 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1793524566 +0000\n\ntools: avoid rewriting same-version OpenSSL updates\n\nReplay the existing update branch onto the current target branch before\nrunning the updater on scheduled runs. Its version check then skips the\nsame version without rewriting the PR, preserving approvals and CI.\n\nThis also carries contributor commits into a newer update. Manual\ndispatches bypass the replay so the update can still be regenerated.\n\nSigned-off-by: Filip Skokan <panva.ip@gmail.com>\nAssisted-by: Codex\nPR-URL: https://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/66999\nReviewed-By: Antoine du Hamel <duhamelantoine1995@gmail.com>","verified_at":"2026-11-01T09:16:07Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nodejs/node/commits/95f3cf072e83d94ac90616c86a370b250f44a8d7","html_url":"https://github.com/nodejs/node/commit/95f3cf072e83d94ac90616c86a370b250f44a8d7","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nodejs/node/commits/95f3cf072e83d94ac90616c86a370b250f44a8d7/comments","author":{"login":"panva","id":241506,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MTUwNg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/241506?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/panva","html_url":"https://github.com/panva","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/panva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/panva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/panva/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/panva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/panva/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/panva/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/panva/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/panva/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/panva/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE